	(text "Implement a CAN transceiver and relevant circuitry to allow a data link with the alpha peripheral board\nwithin the rocket. It might connect to the microcontroller with uart or SPI.\n\nCAN is a protocol invented for automotive applications and is a communication protocol and physical\nlayer specification that allows high speed communication across relatively long wires in high-noise \nenvironments"
